    "short_description": "In a book found in the attic, Manon discovers the past of her family members through their memories, their gestures, their quirks and their little secrets.",
    "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, German, Japanese, Dutch<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA good introduction, captivating, motivating for the future\u2026[...] The old-fashioned point &amp; click is dead, the narrative game is alive and well, and this mix of the two makes the experience particularly modern, intelligent and surprising.\u201d<br>GameSideStory<br><br>\u201cThe game has an overall friendly tone, and if you want a soft-handed narrative that lets you discover things in a clever, thought-provoking way, while still maintaining a very playful sense, you\u2019ll want to brew a nice coffee or tea and kick back with LooK INside.\u201d<br>Indie Games Plus<br>",
